  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Sopan Suresh Dombe vs The State Of Maharashtra And Another on 14 October, 2025 1 In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Bench At Aurangabad. 915 Anticipatory Bail Application No.1811 Of 2025 Sopan Suresh Dombe ... Applicant Versus The State of Maharashtra and Another ... Respondents ..... Shri. Ramankumar Gopal Dodiya, Advocate for the Applicant Shri. M. K. Goyanka, App for the Respondents - State. ..... Coram : Neeraj P. Dhote, J. Dated : October 14, 2025 Per Court :- .",
    "facts": "2. The case of the Prosecution, in brief, is that, on 30.07.2025 the Officers from the Narcotic Cell raided the Pan Shop situated near the bus stand at Jintur and found the banned Gutkha and Tobacco worth Rs.5580/-. They seized the said Articles and lodged the Report with the Jintur Police Station and Crime bearing No.0430/2025 came to be registered for the offence punishable under Sections 123, 223, 274, 275, 3(5) of the Bharatiya Nyaya Sanhita, 2023 (for short, 'BNS') and under Sections 59 (i), 59 (ii) of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006. 3. As per the Prosecution, the Co-accused stated that, the said contraband was supplied by the Applicant. Except Section 123 of the 2 BNS, all the sections are bailable.",
    "arguments": "",
